==Battleground==
*1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16~18 seconds<sup>480f~540f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 123.33 seconds<sup>3,700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 150 seconds<sup>4,500f</sup>, delay 30~32 seconds<sup>900f~960f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Ryu is only at 6% magnification and the peons only 100%.

